{"id":"n21176-1-6","stage":2,"title":"불법 · 非法","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21176-1-6-1","ko":"저 후보는 왜 떨어졌을까?","zh":"那个候选人为什么会落选呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후보는","meaning":"候选人","explanation":"후보：候选人；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"후보","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88102","senseId":"1","lemma":"후보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어졌을까?","meaning":"落榜","explanation":"떨어지다：落榜；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"9","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"7baf75f51c9d0d7d","term":"후보","zh":"候选人","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3","entryId":"88102","definition":"在选举中，为得到某个职位或身份，具备一定资格后参加选举；或指这种人。","pronunciation":["후보"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"落榜","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"未能通过考试、选拔等。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/31173dfcd5dc5b786a8d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21176-1-6-2","ko":"이번에 불법 선거 운동으로 신임을 잃었거든.","zh":"因为这次他因非法选举活动而失去了民众的信任。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불법","meaning":"非法","explanation":"불법：非法","readings":[{"term":"불법","audio":"/audio/e69c1068b3f8d28ee9f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21176","senseId":"1","lemma":"불법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선거","meaning":"选举","explanation":"선거：选举","readings":[{"term":"선거","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16617","senseId":"1","lemma":"선거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동으로","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"2","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신임을","meaning":"信任","explanation":"신임：信任；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신임","audio":"/audio/e29760dc836509c4b588.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91242","senseId":"1","lemma":"신임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃었거든.","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"2","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"e69c1068b3f8d28e","term":"불법","zh":"非法","audio":"/audio/e69c1068b3f8d28ee9f4.mp3","entryId":"21176","definition":"违反法律。","pronunciation":["불법","불뻡"]},{"id":"c091c2a2a2efa68e","term":"선거","zh":"选举","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3","entryId":"16617","definition":"在一定的组织或集团内通过投票挑选代表或管理人员。","pronunciation":["선ː거"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"为实现某目的的活动。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"e29760dc836509c4","term":"신임","zh":"信任","audio":"/audio/e29760dc836509c4b588.mp3","entryId":"91242","definition":"相信并委托事情；或指那份信赖。","pronunciation":["시ː님"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"原本拥有或享受到的东西被抢走或不再拥有。","pronunciation":["일타"]}],"audio":"/audio/64408247ab7989d22358.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.65,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21176","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3753,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个候选人为什么会落选呢？","因为这次他因非法选举活动而失去了民众的信任。","人选选好了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个候选人为什么会落选呢？","因为这次他因非法选举活动而失去了民众的信任。","人选选好了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
